s 3632 112 100 0 Chris Mayer
s 4416 208 100 0 CAD record
s 3632 320 100 0 Copyright
s 3632 288 100 0 Observatory
s 3632 256 100 0 Sciences Ltd.
s 0 208 100 0 The calculation record determines which
s 0 176 100 0 output link will fire. The mask can be used to 
s 0 144 100 0 trigger the ActCSeq record instead.
s 0 112 100 0 This is equivalent to setting the OIWFS to NONE
s 0 80 100 0 so that one can handle OIWFS that don't implement
s 0 48 100 0 certain commands in a simple way.
s 3712 3104 100 0 $Id: agSeqOiwfsDcCad.sch,v 1.6 2013/11/12 18:00:06 gemvx Exp $
